{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"base","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18ReversedCollectionV4Basexmfp"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Collection\/Index"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To find the position that corresponds with this index in the original,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"underlying collection, use that collection’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index(before:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"base"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example declares a function that returns the index of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last even number in the passed array, if one is found. First, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"function finds the position of the last even number as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReversedIndex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in a reversed view of the array of numbers. Next, the function calls the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index(before:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method to return the correct position in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passed array."}]},{"code":["func indexOfLastEven(_ numbers: [Int]) -> Int? {","    let reversedNumbers = numbers.reversed()","    guard let i = reversedNumbers.firstIndex(where: { $0 % 2 == 0 })","        else { return nil }","","    return numbers.index(before: i.base)","}","","let numbers = [10, 20, 13, 19, 30, 52, 17, 40, 51]","if let lastEven = indexOfLastEven(numbers) {","    print(\"Last even number: \\(numbers[lastEven])\")","}","\/\/ Prints \"Last even number: 40\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/reversedcollection\/index\/base"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ReversedCollection\/Index\/base"},"metadata":{"title":"base","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"2.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:s18ReversedCollectionV5IndexV4baseACQzvp","modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"base"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Base","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18ReversedCollectionV4Basexmfp"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The position after this position in the underlying collection."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/co